### 1. Get all flights (existing endpoint)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/flights
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get only available flights
GET http://localhost:8080/api/flights/available
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Test AI chat endpoints (Search flights via AI)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What flights exist from London?"
}

###

### 4. Test AI Chat endpoints (Book flight via AI)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I want to book flight FL001 for Maja B with email maja@example.com"
}

###

### 5. Test AI chat endponts (Cancel flight via AI)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Cancel my booking for maja@example.com"
}